      {
        "id": "install-copies-package",
        "moduleId": "why-install",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "安装做了什么",
        "markdown": "简单来说，安装会把包的内容复制到 Python 导入时会搜索的目录中。理论上，只要手工把源码复制到正确位置也能“安装”一个包；但使用 `conda` 或 `pip` 这类专门工具会更高效、更安全。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000083"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Packages with Python",
                "What Installation Does"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8701,
              "lineEnd": 8742,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "85651d419689e9b2845372bce9a8fc9e2c6a7a3c4c6312def967336a23e9b5f7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "import-depends-on-path",
        "moduleId": "why-install",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：能否导入取决于位置",
        "markdown": "`import` 能否成功，取决于解释器能否在搜索路径里找到对应模块。因此安装的关键不是“下载文件”本身，而是把文件放到解释器会去看的位置；这也是手工复制偶尔也能奏效的原因。\n\n如果只是把源码放在任意目录而不告诉解释器，`import` 仍然会失败。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "install-copies-package"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "site-packages-default",
        "moduleId": "where-installed",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "默认落点：site-packages",
        "markdown": "多数情况下，安装工具会把包复制进当前 Python 安装的 `site-packages` 目录。但 `site-packages` 并不是解释器唯一会搜索的位置。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
