                "What Installation Does"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8701,
              "lineEnd": 8742,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "85651d419689e9b2845372bce9a8fc9e2c6a7a3c4c6312def967336a23e9b5f7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "what-site-packages-is",
        "moduleId": "where-installed",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：site-packages 属于某个环境",
        "markdown": "`site-packages` 是某个 Python 环境的一部分。不同环境（例如为不同项目创建的虚拟环境）各自拥有自己的 `site-packages`，所以“装到了哪里”要结合当前使用的解释器来判断。这也解释了为什么在 A 环境安装的包，在 B 环境里可能 `import` 不到。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "site-packages-default"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "install-records-metadata",
        "moduleId": "where-installed",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：安装还会留下记录",
        "markdown": "除了复制文件，包管理器通常还会记录已安装包的名称、版本和依赖信息，便于之后查询、升级或卸载。文件放在哪里决定能否导入，安装记录则决定环境能否管理这些包；两者是同一个安装过程的不同侧面。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "site-packages-default"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sys-path-list",
        "moduleId": "search-path-order",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "搜索路径：sys.path",
        "markdown": "Python 的 `sys.path` 是一个目录列表，解释器按这个列表查找要导入的模块。可以把它类比成 shell 里的 `PATH`：`PATH` 告诉 shell 去哪里找可执行程序，`sys.path` 告诉 Python 去哪里找模块。\n\n在解释器里可以直接查看：\n\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000083"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Creating Packages with Python",
                "What Installation Does"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8701,
              "lineEnd": 8742,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "85651d419689e9b2845372bce9a8fc9e2c6a7a3c4c6312def967336a23e9b5f7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sys-path-example",
        "moduleId": "search-path-order",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "一段真实的 sys.path 输出",
        "markdown": "一个典型的输出如下：\n\n```text\n['',\n '/Users/amira/anaconda3/envs/pyzipf/lib/python37.zip',\n '/Users/amira/anaconda3/envs/pyzipf/lib/python3.7',\n '/Users/amira/anaconda3/envs/pyzipf/lib/python3.7/lib-dynload',\n '/Users/amira/.local/lib/python3.7/site-packages',\n '/Users/amira/anaconda3/envs/pyzipf/lib/python3.7/site-packages',\n '/Users/amira/pyzipf']\n```\n\n列表开头的空字符串表示“当前目录”。其余是这套 Python 安装的系统路径，会因机器而异。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
